1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
How to play PocketRoles (3 minutes)
Only the host installs it; players stay vanilla

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
PocketRoles in the right window of the menu = ready

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Create a room as usual: Play -> Online -> Create Game

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Pick the map and player count. Players install nothing

5
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:53,000
The room code is in the right panel (share it on Discord etc.)
Bottom right: PocketRoles version and region

6
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Edit -> POCKETROLES opens the role settings

7
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Tabs: Roles / Lobby / Chat / Looks / Host
Just set counts and chances. Press ? for a description

8
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
"> Vanilla settings" shows the original game settings
(kill cooldown, voting time can go beyond the vanilla limits)

9
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Chat commands: /h lists them, /show prints the settings

10
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:52,000
/time = lobby time left, /test on = test mode (start alone)

11
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Players type /cmd h -> help only they can see
/cmd n -> their role. Chat is auto-translated (DeepL/Google)

12
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Press Start: the intro runs as usual. Role holders get a private notice

13
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:50,000
13 roles: Sheriff, Mayor, Snitch, Jackal, Jester and more
The lobby timer extends automatically

14
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:10,000
F7 twice = end the game and be back in the lobby in seconds
F8 ends a meeting, F9 cancels the start countdown

15
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Questions: pocketroles.report+help@gmail.com
